{"id":"f98fb2ec31a9f521","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-readoncepositive.md","title":"Positive part of the read-once class","display":"thm-readoncepositive — Positive part of the read-once class","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-readoncepositive","aliases":["27-thm-readoncepositive"],"display":"thm-readoncepositive — Positive part of the read-once class","depends_on":["[[27-df-readoncefunc]]","[[27-df-monotone]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§10.1 signed-to-positive convention; local interface lemma","source_printed_pages":"448","source_pdf_pages":"472","verification_status":"source-background-checked-local-De-Morgan-and-essential-leaf-proof-reviewed","source_relation":"local-definition-or-lemma-with-book-background"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-readoncepositive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-readoncepositive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-readoncepositive — Positive part of the read-once class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"abdabeb50455fed9\" href=\"?note=abdabeb50455fed9\" title=\"27-df-readoncefunc\">27-df-readoncefunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" href=\"?note=640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" title=\"27-df-monotone\">27-df-monotone</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§10.1 signed-to-positive convention; local interface lemma"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"448"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"472"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-background-checked-local-De-Morgan-and-essential-leaf-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_relation","html":"local-definition-or-lemma-with-book-background"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"abdabeb50455fed9\" href=\"?note=abdabeb50455fed9\" title=\"27-df-readoncefunc\">27-df-readoncefunc</a>，正函数类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" href=\"?note=640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" title=\"27-df-monotone\">27-df-monotone</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n=\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Monotone}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n=\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Monotone}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 §10.1（印刷 p.448／PDF p.472）给出带符号 read-once 可通过变量翻转转正的说明；本式是本目录允许常量与虚变量后的本地接口引理，已核对下述论证，不将它虚称为原书编号定理。</li>\n<li>先用 De Morgan 律把否定推至叶子，再消去常量分支，保留每个变量至多一次。非恒定简化树中的每个叶子变量都是本质变量：沿其到根的路径，将每个兄弟子树赋为对应操作的中性值即可使根随该叶子变化。若某叶子是否定文字，函数对该变量严格递减，与整体正性矛盾。因此正函数的剩余叶子全为正文字；常函数由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 表示。反向由正公式的结构归纳立即成立。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-readoncefunc","status":"resolved","id":"abdabeb50455fed9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-readoncefunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-monotone","status":"resolved","id":"640eb8f2fbffd9d9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-monotone]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-readoncefunc","status":"resolved","id":"abdabeb50455fed9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n$ 见 [[27-df-readoncefunc]]，正函数类 $\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 见 [[27-df-monotone]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-monotone","status":"resolved","id":"640eb8f2fbffd9d9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n$ 见 [[27-df-readoncefunc]]，正函数类 $\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 见 [[27-df-monotone]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Monotone}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n=\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Monotone}_n.","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false}],"bytes":1901,"backlinks":[{"id":"abdabeb50455fed9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"常量及虚变量沿用 [[27-df-readonceexpr]] 的至多一次约定；正类与一般类中的正函数相同，见 [[27-thm-readoncepositive]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-544","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-readoncepositive|thm-readoncepositive — Positive part of the read-once class]]"},{"id":"2258152dd7a3f9d8","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n$ 见 [[27-df-readoncefunc]]，其正部分接口见 [[27-thm-readoncepositive]]。"},{"id":"abebc662ad42f28a","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$V(g),E(g),\\mathrm{Normal}_n,\\mathrm{P4Free}$ 的定义域为 $g\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$，见 [[27-thm-readoncegraph]] 的上游 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]；正性接口见 [[27-thm-readoncepositive]]。"}],"outgoing":["abdabeb50455fed9","640eb8f2fbffd9d9"]}